{"id":"lot","lemma":"lot","pos":"noun","rank":2380,"glosses":["share (of inheritance)","plot (of land)","batch (of goods for sale)"],"ipa":"/lo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/82/Fr-lot.ogg/Fr-lot.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lots"},"formAudio":{"lots":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-lots.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai tiré le gros lot.","en":"I hit the jackpot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"big, thick, fat"},null]},{"text":"J'ai mon lot de doutes.","en":"I have my share of doubts.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"doubts, misgivings"}]},{"text":"Les lots seront attribués à la fin du concours.","en":"Prizes will be awarded at the end of the contest.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"competition"}],"phrases":[[4,7,"in the end"]]},{"text":"C'est le lot des hommes que de souffrir.","en":"It is man's destiny to suffer.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"man","l":"homme"},null,null,{"g":"to suffer"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"how"]]},{"text":"J'ai décroché le gros lot.","en":"I've hit the jackpot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to unhook","l":"décrocher"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"big, thick, fat"},null]}]}